# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "A short guide on integrating Qiskit into an external provider's quantum resources."
msgstr "Panduan singkat tentang cara mengintegrasikan Qiskit dengan sumber daya kuantum dari provider eksternal."

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Integrate external quantum resources with Qiskit"
msgstr "Membuat provider"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Integrate external quantum resources with Qiskit {#integrate-external-quantum-resources-with-qiskit}"
msgstr "Mengintegrasikan sumber daya kuantum eksternal dengan Qiskit {#integrate-external-quantum-resources-with-qiskit}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Qiskit SDK is built to support third parties in creating external providers of quantum resources.\n"
msgstr "Qiskit SDK dirancang untuk mendukung pihak ketiga dalam membuat provider eksternal dari sumber daya kuantum.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This means that any organization that develops or deploys quantum compute resources can integrate their services into Qiskit and tap into its userbase.\n"
msgstr "Artinya, organisasi mana pun yang mengembangkan atau menggunakan sumber daya komputasi kuantum bisa mengintegrasikan layanan mereka ke dalam Qiskit dan memanfaatkan basis penggunanya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Doing so requires creating a package that supports requests for quantum compute resources and returns them to the user.\n"
msgstr "Untuk melakukan ini, kamu perlu membuat paket yang mendukung permintaan sumber daya komputasi kuantum dan mengembalikannya ke pengguna.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additionally, the package must allow users to submit jobs and retrieve their results through an implementation of the `qiskit.primitives` objects.\n"
msgstr "Selain itu, paket tersebut harus memungkinkan pengguna untuk mengirim job dan mengambil hasilnya melalui implementasi objek `qiskit.primitives`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Providing access to backends {#providing-access-to-backends}"
msgstr "Menyediakan akses ke Backend {#providing-access-to-backends}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In order for users to transpile and execute `QuantumCircuit` objects using external resources, they need to instantiate an object containing a [`Target`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) which provides information about a QPU's constraints such as its connectivity, basis gates, and number of qubits. This can be provided through an interface similar to the [`QiskitRuntimeService`](../api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service) through which a user can make requests for a QPU. This object should, at minimum, contain a `Target`, but a simpler approach would be to return a [`BackendV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) instance.\n"
msgstr "Agar pengguna bisa men-transpile dan mengeksekusi objek `QuantumCircuit` menggunakan sumber daya eksternal, mereka perlu membuat instansi objek yang berisi [`Target`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) yang menyediakan informasi tentang batasan QPU seperti konektivitasnya, gate basis, dan jumlah qubit. Ini bisa disediakan melalui antarmuka yang mirip dengan [`QiskitRuntimeService`](../api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service) yang memungkinkan pengguna membuat permintaan untuk QPU. Objek ini setidaknya harus berisi sebuah `Target`, tapi pendekatan yang lebih sederhana adalah mengembalikan instansi [`BackendV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An example implementation may look something like:\n"
msgstr "Contoh implementasinya bisa terlihat seperti ini:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Providing an interface for execution {#providing-an-interface-for-execution}"
msgstr "Menyediakan antarmuka untuk eksekusi {#providing-an-interface-for-execution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In addition to providing a service returning hardware configurations, a service providing access to external QPU resources also might also support the execution of quantum workloads. Exposing that capability can be done by creating implementations of the Qiskit primitive base classes; for example the [`BasePrimitiveJob`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BasePrimitiveJob), [`BaseEstimatorV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BaseEstimatorV2) and [`BaseSamplerV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BaseSamplerV2) among others. At minimum, these interfaces should be able to provide a method for execution, querying job status, and returning the job results.\n"
msgstr "Selain menyediakan layanan yang mengembalikan konfigurasi perangkat keras, layanan yang memberikan akses ke sumber daya QPU eksternal juga mungkin mendukung eksekusi beban kerja kuantum. Kemampuan tersebut bisa diekspos dengan membuat implementasi dari kelas dasar primitif Qiskit; misalnya [`BasePrimitiveJob`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BasePrimitiveJob), [`BaseEstimatorV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BaseEstimatorV2) dan [`BaseSamplerV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BaseSamplerV2) di antaranya. Setidaknya, antarmuka ini harus menyediakan metode untuk eksekusi, mengecek status job, dan mengembalikan hasil job.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To handle job status and results, the Qiskit SDK provides a [`DataBin`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.DataBin), [`PubResult`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PubResult), [`PrimitiveResult`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PrimitiveResult), and [`BasePrimitiveJob`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BasePrimitiveJob) objects should be used.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menangani status dan hasil job, Qiskit SDK menyediakan objek [`DataBin`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.DataBin), [`PubResult`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PubResult), [`PrimitiveResult`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PrimitiveResult), dan [`BasePrimitiveJob`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BasePrimitiveJob) yang harus digunakan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "See the `qiskit.primitives` [API documentation](../api/qiskit/primitives) as well as the reference implementations [`BackendEstimatorV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BackendEstimatorV2) and [`BackendSampleV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BackendSamplerV2) for more information.\n"
msgstr "Lihat [dokumentasi API](../api/qiskit/primitives) `qiskit.primitives` serta implementasi referensi [`BackendEstimatorV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BackendEstimatorV2) dan [`BackendSampleV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BackendSamplerV2) untuk informasi lebih lanjut.\n"

